{"id":"n48796-3-7","stage":3,"title":"독 · 狠毒","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48796-3-7-1","ko":"민준이는 잘못해 놓고도 사과도 안 하고 떳떳하더라.","zh":"敏俊做了错事之后不仅不道歉，还一副理所当然的样子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이는","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}},{"text":"잘못해","meaning":"做错，做得不好","explanation":"잘못하다：做错，做得不好；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잘못하다","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69936","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘못해","audio":"/audio/bd8015ec8938c27caa5d.mp3"}},{"text":"놓고도","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓고도","audio":"/audio/a5f088f76bca6f92649b.mp3"}},{"text":"사과도","meaning":"道歉","explanation":"사과：道歉；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"사과","audio":"/audio/46fc35121d1a4b332863.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15830","senseId":"1","lemma":"사과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사과도","audio":"/audio/a1d84448c7b213bf4263.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做（사과를 하다：道歉）","explanation":"하다：做（사과를 하다：道歉）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"떳떳하더라.","meaning":"正大光明，堂堂正正","explanation":"떳떳하다：正大光明，堂堂正正；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"떳떳하다","audio":"/audio/7c06000b0d2fc8919774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54083","senseId":"1","lemma":"떳떳하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떳떳하더라","audio":"/audio/6370202c86a7152a5af2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c088e8817916a36c","term":"잘못하다","zh":"做错，做得不好","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3","entryId":"69936","definition":"做得有错或不对。","pronunciation":["잘모타다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"46fc35121d1a4b33","term":"사과","zh":"道歉","audio":"/audio/46fc35121d1a4b332863.mp3","entryId":"15830","definition":"承认自己的不是并请求原谅的行为。","pronunciation":["사ː과"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做（사과를 하다：道歉）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做（사과를 하다：道歉）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"7c06000b0d2fc891","term":"떳떳하다","zh":"正大光明，堂堂正正","audio":"/audio/7c06000b0d2fc8919774.mp3","entryId":"54083","definition":"问心无愧，理直气壮。","pronunciation":["떧떠타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5157471dccc1bf711e36.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48796-3-7-2","ko":"맞아. 민준이 눈빛에 독이 들었던데.","zh":"对啊，他那眼神里简直带着恶意呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아","audio":"/audio/c92874385c2bbee2ea2e.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이","